READING KEY: 'p·h' = prime x height-multiplier. Watch (i) N_mc growth vs Q,
(ii) the size histogram's shift toward 13 (slack = 13 - minsize) at the first
7-rung vs the 2-rung, (iii) whether slack relaxes at greater heights. The
first-rung collapse conjecture (HYP-8025) predicts the slack squeeze at p->7p
sharpens as p grows.

